lockdown kiosk
gracefully handle exceptions to keep kiosk running
user interface
Add Stepper Code

For API into production make following changes:
{
    "url": "https://api.yourdomain.com",  // https, no port (443 is implied)
    "verify_ssl": true
    "connect_timeout": 5,
    "read_timeout": 10
}

# dev - might use self-signed cert or no cert
resp = requests.post(url, json={...}, timeout=5, verify=False)

# production - verify the certificate chain
resp = requests.post(url, json={...}, timeout=5, verify=True)

verify_ssl = cfg.get("verify_ssl", True)
resp = requests.post(url, json={...}, timeout=5, verify=verify_ssl)

timeout = (cfg.get("connect_timeout", 5), cfg.get("read_timeout", 10))
resp = requests.post(url, json={...}, timeout=timeout)

